 ants and then left click to make them go/do somehting)<br>-&gt;D: Dig mode (Left click twice to set initial and final positions)<br>-&gt;B: Build mode (WIP)<br>-&gt;Right click the queen block to access its menu.</p>\r\n<p><br>This is my first ever semi-playable game, and mi first game uploaded to itch io!<br></p>\r\n<p>It was made for the &quot;New year new skills&quot; game jam in a week, so dont expect too much playtesting.<br>I also have plans of turning the game into a fully fleshed out title so all feedback is welcome!</p>\r\n<p>Thanks for playing!</p></div><div class=\"more_information_toggle\"><div class=\"toggle_row\"><a class=\"toggle_info_btn\" href=\"javascript:void(0)\">More information<svg width=\"12\" viewBox=\"0 0 37 20\" class=\"svgicon icon_down_tick\" aria-hidden version=\"1.1\" height=\"6\" role=\"img\"><path d=\"m2.0858 0c-1.1535 0-2.0858 0.86469-2.0858 1.9331 0 0.5139 0.21354 1.0183 0.38704 1.1881l18.113 16.879 18.112-16.879c0.174-0.1696 0.388-0.674 0.388-1.1879 0-1.0684-0.932-1.9331-2.086-1.9331-0.577 0-1.111 0.23008-1.49 0.57992l-14.924 13.894-14.925-13.893c-0.3777-0.34998-0.9134-0.581-1.4902-0.581z\"/></svg></a></div><div class=\"info_panel_wrapper\"><div id=\"game_info_panel_7381973\" class=\"game_info_panel_widget base_widget\"><table><tbody><tr><td>Status</td><td><a href=\"https://itch.io/games/prototypes\">Prototype</a></td></tr><tr><td>Author</td><td><a href=\"https://plusalecs.itch.io\">PlusAlecs</a></td></tr><tr><td>Genre</td><td><a href=\"https://itch.io/games/genre-strategy\">Strategy</a></td></tr><tr><td>Tags</td><td><a href=\"https://itch.io/games/tag-colony\">colony</a>, <a href=\"https://itch.io/games/tag-colony-sim\">colony-sim</a>, <a href=\"https://itch.io/games/tag-indie\">Indie</a>, <a href=\"https://itch.io/games/tag-pixel-art\">Pixel Art</a>, <a href=\"https://itch.io/games/tag-real-time\">Real-Time</a>, <a href=\"https://itch.io/games/tag-real-time-strategy\">Real time strategy</a></td></tr></tbody></table></div></div><